      "title": "Hive",
      "text": "%hive\n-- Hive 4.1.0 (HiveServer2, moteur Tez)\nSELECT category,\n       COUNT(*)              AS nb_ventes,\n       ROUND(SUM(amount), 2) AS chiffre_affaires\nFROM sales_db.transactions\nGROUP BY category\nORDER BY chiffre_affaires DESC",
